flowchart TD
    subgraph User_Space [User Interface]
        User([Public Servant])
        SPA[Windtunnel SPA]
    end

    subgraph Core_Platform [Windtunnel Orchestration]
        Backend[Windtunnel Backend]
        DB[(Run Database & Git Store)]
    end

    subgraph AI_Engine [AI Analysis & Generation]
        LLM[LLM Engine]
        CodeGen[Prototype Generator]
    end

    User -->|1. Submits AI Idea & Constraints| SPA
    SPA -->|2. API Request (Create Run)| Backend
    Backend -->|3. Initialize Run State| DB
    Backend -->|4. Send Outline & Prompts| LLM
    LLM -->|5. Generate Feasibility & Architecture| Backend
    Backend -->|6. Request Interactive Prototype| CodeGen
    CodeGen -->|7. Generate Tailwind/HTML/JS| Backend
    Backend -->|8. Commit Assets & Update Run| DB
    Backend -->|9. Stream Assessment & Prototype| SPA
    SPA -->|10. Render Interactive Sandbox & Map| User